.TH RANMA-WAIT 1 "" "ranma 0.1.0" "ranma manual"
.SH NAME
ranma\-wait \- Wait for a pane to end, and exit with its program\*(Aqs status
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBranma wait\fR [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-pane\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Wait for a pane to end, and exit with its program\*(Aqs status
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-pane\fR \fI<PANE>\fR
The pane (from \fBranma panes\fR); the one this runs in when left out
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBranma\fR(1)
